  "historyNote": "#2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96, EXPIRED: 5-30-04 New. #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
